OL,3,GNEWSANoah Donohoe inquest jury finds
OL,4,Afailings by department officials
OL,5,Apossibly contributed to death
OL,6,
OL,7,FInquest finds Stormont's Department for
OL,8,FInfrastructure "erred" in its
OL,9,Fmaintenance of the entrance to a tunnel
OL,10,Fwhere Noah Donohoe was found dead
OL,12,FThe jury finds it was possible, but not
OL,13,Fprobable, that failings by the
OL,14,Fdepartment contributed to his death
OL,16,FJurors also find there were no police
OL,17,Ffailings that contributed to the
OL,18,F14-year-old's death but identify 13
OL,19,Ffailings during the investigation
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/4
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
