OL,3,GNEWSANoah Donohoe inquest jury finds
OL,4,Afailings by department officials
OL,5,Apossibly contributed to death
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe jury reached a unanimous verdict
OL,8,Fafter five days of deliberations. They
OL,9,Fhad 10 questions to answer
OL,11,FTwo questions were about when and where
OL,12,FNoah died - they say it was between
OL,13,F19:00 and midnight on Sunday 21 June
OL,14,F2020, and in the lower reaches of the
OL,15,Fculvert or underground tunnel
OL,17,FAn inquest verdict at last but many
OL,18,Fmysteries remain about Noah's death,
OL,19,Fwrites BBC News NI's Kevin Sharkey
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/4
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
